OL,3,GNEWSAConcert to be held for police
OL,4,Aofficer killed on duty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribute concert is set to be held for
OL,7,Fa 27-year-old police officer who was
OL,8,Fkilled in the line of duty.
OL,10,FPC Bradley Corke, from Hastings in East
OL,11,FSussex, died in March following a car
OL,12,Fcrash while responding to an emergency
OL,13,Fcall in Kent.
OL,15,FHis father Steve said several dramatic
OL,16,Fsocieties were "uniting in memory" of
OL,17,FBradley for two shows on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
