OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said they were raising money for the
OL,7,FAir Ambulance Charity Kent, Surrey and
OL,8,FSussex, which had given the family an
OL,9,Fextra 48 hours to say goodbye to their
OL,10,Fson after he was critically injured.
